2013 Edinburgh Jazz &amp; Blues Festival sell-outs return.&nbsp;
They &lsquo;stand out from the crowd thanks to Rosie Nimmo&rsquo;s confident and sultry vocals matched with an impressive repertoire of traditional and modern jazz numbers&rsquo; (Edinburgh Evening News).

